            "item_body_color": "",
            "item_body_size_desktop": 14,
            "item_body_size_mobile": 13,
            "item_1_title": "Description",
            "item_1_body": "<p>Built on the V8 Max DNA, the V8 Ultra brings a sportier feel, upgraded comfort, and ride-ready features to every adventure. Engineered for city cruising and off-road trails alike, it delivers powerful performance, smooth dual-suspension handling, and an integrated Bluetooth audio system to keep every ride excitin</p>",
            "item_2_title": "Key Features",
            "item_2_body": "<p>• <strong>Powerful Motor:</strong> 750W sustained / 1000W Peak High-Torque Motor (up to 32 MPH top speed).</p><p>• <strong>All-Terrain Dual Suspension:</strong> Sporty carbon-fiber dual suspension to absorb potholes and rough terrain.</p><p>• <strong>Massive Range:</strong> Up to 100+ miles of pedal assist with the dual waterproof 48V 15Ah battery setup.</p><p>• <strong>Built-In Bluetooth Speaker:</strong> High-output audio integrated directly into the headlight housing.</p><p>• <strong>Advanced Safety:</strong> UL 2849 & UL 2271 certified electrical system, hydraulic brakes, extra-bright LED lighting, and integrated turn signals.</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "item_3_body": "<p>• <strong>Delivery:</strong> Free 2–7 day standard shipping across the United States.</p><p>• <strong>Returns:</strong> 30-day hassle-free return policy.</p><p>• <strong>Warranty:</strong> 1-Year worry-free warranty covering all core components.</p><p>• <strong>Local Support:</strong> Dedicated U.S.-based customer care and replacement parts readily available.</p>",
            "item_4_title": "What's in the Box?",
            "item_4_body": "<p>• 1x V8 Ultra E-Bike (85% pre-assembled)</p><p>• 1x Smart Battery Charger (5–6 hr charge time)</p><p>• 1x NFC Card & Key Fob access&nbsp;</p><p>• 1x Passenger Back Seat & Rear Foot Pegs&nbsp;</p><p>• 1x Portable Tire Pump & Multi-Tool Kit&nbsp;</p><p>• 1x Extra Brake Pads set & User Manual&nbsp;</p>",
            "item_5_title": "Technical Specs",
            "item_5_body": "<p>• <strong>Top Speed:</strong> 32 MPH (Unlocked)&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Motor:</strong> 750W (1000W Peak)&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Battery:</strong> 48V 15Ah Waterproof (Single or Dual Battery option)&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Tires:</strong> 20\" x 4.0\" All-Terrain Fat Tires&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Gears:</strong> Shimano 7-Speed Transmission&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Brakes:</strong> Hydraulic Disc Brakes&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Max Payload:</strong> 330 lbs (150 kg)&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Bike Weight:</strong> 94 lbs&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Recommended Height:</strong> 5'4\" – 6'5\"&nbsp;</p>",
            "item_6_title": "",
            "item_6_body": ""
          }
